Chapter: ProductivityDb
  cites Data chapter Schema
  cites Data chapter Row
  cites Data chapter Catalog
  cites Data chapter Heap
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Database schema for the CVMM productivity suite. Defines all tables,
 indexes, and seed data for notes, recipes, calendar events, todos,
 contacts, parties, home projects, car maintenance, budget, fitness,
 garden, and reading list. Each domain is a set of related tables with
 proper foreign keys. The data quire handles storage, indexing, MVCC,
 and transactions — this chapter is purely schema and query helpers.

Section: Notes Tables

  notes-table : TableDef
  notes-table = table-def-with-pk "notes" [
    col-def-not-null "id" ColInteger,
    col-def-not-null "title" ColText,
    col-def "body" ColText,
    col-def-not-null "folder" ColText,
    col-def-not-null "color" ColText,
    col-def-not-null "pinned" ColBoolean,
    col-def-not-null "archived" ColBoolean,
    col-def-not-null "created" ColInteger,
    col-def-not-null "modified" ColInteger,
    col-def "word-count" ColInteger
  ] ["id"]

  note-tags-table : TableDef
  note-tags-table = table-def-with-pk "note_tags" [
    col-def-not-null "note-id" ColInteger,
    col-def-not-null "tag" ColText
  ] ["note-id", "tag"]

  note-folders-table : TableDef
  note-folders-table = table-def-with-pk "note_folders" [
    col-def-not-null "name" ColText,
    col-def "parent" ColText,
    col-def-not-null "sort-order" ColInteger
  ] ["name"]

Section: Recipe Tables

  recipes-table : TableDef
  recipes-table = table-def-with-pk "recipes" [
